1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,580
AI agents are starting to spend company money.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,620
And a limit written in a prompt … is only a request.

3
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,070
So who holds the pen?

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,170
Purser.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:20,070
Agents propose. The CFO signs the exact terms, with Face ID or a passkey.

6
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:22,850
Then the payment rails enforce the limit, again.

7
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:25,620
Two locks. One signature.

8
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:28,020
Don't take our word for it.

9
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:32,070
Change one cent after signing. Refused.

10
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:36,020
A charge over the card limit? Airwallex declined it.

11
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:40,590
A payout, held in approval, until the owner said yes.

12
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:46,170
Over the agent's cap? Metal refused it. On chain.

13
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:49,280
The audit chain, anchored on chain.

14
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:53,090
Fifty-two attacks. Money moved: zero.

15
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:59,340
A hostile model. Three hundred and eighty tool calls. Zero unsafe.

16
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:05,010
Your agents do the work. Your CFO signs the exceptions.

17
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:08,860
Purser. Try it yourself.
